Error [E0427]: a stored-reference field needs `&` on its type
  --> tests/ui/ref_old_marker_retired.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     #Ref(src) text: String
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Ref(owner)` only names the owner — the `&` on the type is what makes the field store a reference (D-REF-SHORTHAND1)
 Fix: write `#Ref(src) text: &String` (add the `&`), or drop `#Ref(src)` and write `text: &String`
